# The program ELF this workspace drives is a build product of
# `programs/clutch-sbf/program`, staged here by `run_svm_tests.sh`.  A binary
# checked into the tree would be a second, silently stale copy of the program.
#
# `cargo-build-sbf` also emits a deploy keypair beside the ELF.  It is key
# material, it is generated, and it is never used here — these tests deploy at
# the fixed `clutch_svm_fixture::PROGRAM_ID` instead — so it is ignored rather
# than committed.
tests/fixtures/*
# Public, provenance-pinned provider binaries and signed synthetic proof bytes
# are source fixtures, not locally built Clutch artifacts. A clean clone needs
# them to run the explicit non-production local-real campaign.
!tests/fixtures/real-pyth-local/
!tests/fixtures/real-pyth-local/**
target/
